{"id":2600,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为助力备考学子明晰考研方向、掌握科学复习方法、缓解备考焦虑，发挥优秀学子朋辈引领作用，5月31日，“学长学姐谈升学”第5期在“一站式”学生社区博学书院顺利举办。本次活动邀请我院上岸优秀学子付琦璐主讲，为备考学子分享实战备考经验、高效学习技巧及心态调节方法，帮助大家理清备考思路，从容应对考研备考。</p><p>在资源分享环节，付琦璐结合自身学习体验，推荐公共课与专业课优质网课及授课教师，对比不同师资授课特点。她提醒同学们，无需堆砌海量学习资源，应结合自身短板和学习习惯择优选择，精准突破学习瓶颈，有效提升复习效率。备考中出现焦虑、懈怠等情绪实属常态，大家无需攀比他人进度、自我内耗，应坚守自身复习节奏，制定专属学习计划，稳步落实每日任务，以平稳自律的心态坚持全程备考。</p><p>&nbsp;本次交流会内容详实、实用性强，有效解答了学子备考疑惑，缓解了备考压力，进一步明晰了考研备考路径。下一步，学院将持续深耕学风建设，常态化开展朋辈帮扶活动，以榜样力量引领学子笃学奋进，助力全院备考学子坚定信念、潜心深耕，逐梦研途、不负韶华。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KolrOVM8C4UmvZLxm78UzQfLlUDM4-JZLRN8L7-DMRW2ozL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyanSy8LSyYLNlPLzTRUNCbU46kL4GiM7LDLlrRM4UbMzTFMRC8ozWRnmMFnRNaozCJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8Lz7bgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24119&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/10E4122E119CBF9C7B3054C61EC74959/46492CF3/D9096\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"450\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KnzlObMlLaL4Lsox7liLRUanNCPnz7Janz98M7-bLll8nRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhkLSybLkh2n7MVMzV7UzCYUlnfnzUYUN-DUzUsnRUDo7QFUmGbUzA2LNnFL4C4L8CagjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYMR7PoSbw6208c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24119&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KLmCODMRLDMm9anxRvDM7QfM77DM7LJbUl-4U4T2MmlDUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyYM1y8MSyDLR-bLlnRLmvPUlMRMz6RMNQfU4UsLzfRo7WFUNCsnNQ7UNnFLzGbo77DgjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYMR7PoSbw6208c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24119&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9264560291DC271ACC57C6FAC4710C8B/BF7FFDBD/1098A6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"450\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KLzMOfLR9PU8rfLxmvbn7CDUmn2L4nJ7M7WfolLYLRGsUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyYLSysoky8Um-PLzUiL4WRL8UPoRNYMR9DMNQVUz6RM8nFMzvio7UiolMFMlCbL7LbgjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYMR7PoSbw6208c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24119&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KolrOVM8C4UmvZLxm78UzQfLlUDM4-JZLRN8L7-DMRW2ozL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyanSy8LSyY